-- LANGTON'S ANT  ·  one ant, two rules:
--   on a dark square: turn right, paint it white, step forward
--   on a white square: turn left, paint it dark,  step forward
-- Pure chaos for ~10,000 steps... then it suddenly builds an ordered "highway".

grid is []
repeat with i from 1 to 1764
  add {on: no} to grid
ax is 21
ay is 21
dir is 0

to update
  repeat 8 times
    hi is ay * 42 + ax + 1
    here is item hi of grid
    if here.on
      decrease dir by 1
      here.on is no
    else
      increase dir by 1
      here.on is yes
    d4 is dir + 4
    dir is d4 mod 4
    if dir is 0 decrease ay by 1
    if dir is 1 increase ax by 1
    if dir is 2 increase ay by 1
    if dir is 3 decrease ax by 1
    aw is ax + 42
    ax is aw mod 42
    ah is ay + 42
    ay is ah mod 42

to draw
  clear screen to black
  repeat with y from 0 to 41
    repeat with x from 0 to 41
      ci is y * 42 + x + 1
      c is item ci of grid
      if c.on draw rect at x * 3, y * 3 size 3, 3 in white
  draw rect at ax * 3, ay * 3 size 3, 3 in red

run game with update and draw
